# Last matching pattern wins, so order from general to specific.
# Every owner listed must have write access, or the rule silently does nothing.
# Gitignore-style negation is NOT supported here.

*                       @Profit-Rise-Consulting

# The document spine changes the contract. Route it deliberately.
/PRD.md                 @Profit-Rise-Consulting
/TRD.md                 @Profit-Rise-Consulting
/DESIGN.md              @Profit-Rise-Consulting
/WIREFRAME.md           @Profit-Rise-Consulting
/docs/adr/              @Profit-Rise-Consulting
/docs/architecture/     @Profit-Rise-Consulting

# Anything that can change what runs in CI, or with what permissions.
/.github/workflows/     @Profit-Rise-Consulting
/.github/CODEOWNERS     @Profit-Rise-Consulting
/AGENTS.md              @Profit-Rise-Consulting
